                <Text>
                    <LocaText>
                        <English>
                            <Text>Madame Kahina's sailors say that in your lands, lions, parrots and elephants live side by side in great gardens. Is it true? I must see it with my own eyes — or at least in a picture.</Text>
                            <Status>Exported</Status>
                        </English>
                    </LocaText>
                    <LineID>41381</LineID>
                </Text>
                <AudioText>
                    <AudioAsset>1404000385</AudioAsset>
