                    <Name>RQ_Nomad_Photo_ExoticNature_Story</Name>
                </Standard>
                <Text>
                    <LocaText>
                        <English>
                            <Text>&lt;b&gt;Sailors from Madame Kahina's harbour tell wondrous tales&lt;/b&gt; of the Old World, where animals from every corner of the earth are said to live together in great gardens. The Nomad, who has spent his life among wild creatures, longs to see this marvel and asks you for a photograph.</Text>
                            <Status>Exported</Status>
                        </English>
                    </LocaText>
                    <LineID>44177</LineID>
                </Text>
            </Values>
